repository-code: "https://github.com/Mediaeater/On_the_Calculation_of_The_Human-AI_Agency_Spectrum"
abstract: >-
  A six-layer framework (L0-L5) that maps qualitative standards like
  "human-led" and "significant human control" to operational configurations,
  synthesizing legal requirements (USCO, EU AI Act), professional standards
  (WGA, SAG-AFTRA, DGA), cognitive research on human-AI interaction, and
  market analysis of compliance-driven tiers.
